+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Build a playground with rollupOptions.output.inlineDynamicImports set, whose entry imports a module both statically and dynamically, and check the build log has no ineffective dynamic import warning (playground/dynamic-import-inline/__tests__/dynamic-import-inline.spec.ts) [AC-1]
+
+## 2. Reporter
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Skip the ineffective dynamic import check when dynamic imports are inlined (packages/vite/src/node/plugins/reporter.ts)
